SUMMARY:Sarah Colonna LIVE at Brad Garrett's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260803T060032Z
DTSTART:20260804T200000Z
DESCRIPTION:This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you
	 purchase tickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nOfficial Ti
	ckets\nResale Tickets \nSarah Colonna LIVE at Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\n
	Comedian\, actress\, and bestselling author Sarah Colonna headlines Brad G
	arrett’s Comedy Club inside MGM Grand in Las Vegas on August 4\, 2026. Bes
	t known for her years as a roundtable regular on Chelsea Lately\, Sarah br
	ings her sharp wit and candid humor to the Strip for a night you won’t for
	get. \nEvent Details\nDate: Tuesday\, August 4\, 2026\nTime: 8:00 PM PT\nV
	enue: Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\nAddress: 3799 Las Vegas Blvd South\, Las
	 Vegas\, NV 89109 (inside MGM Grand)\nAge Requirement: 18+ with valid phot
	o ID\nParking: MGM Grand parking available \nAbout Sarah Colonna\nSarah Co
	lonna is a stand-up comedian\, actress\, and New York Times bestselling au
	thor best known as a roundtable regular on E!’s Chelsea Lately. She has ap
	peared on Awkward\, Anger Management\, and The Goldbergs\, and has release
	d multiple stand-up specials. Her books Life As I Blow It and Has Anyone S
	een My Pants? were both bestsellers. \nWhat to Expect\n\nHeadlining stand-
	up set by Sarah Colonna\nSpecial appearance by Brad Garrett\nIntimate show
	room setting inside MGM Grand\nSharp\, candid\, and relatable comedy\n18+ 
	show with adult humor\nBest available seating within purchased zone\n\nVen
	ue Information\nBrad Garrett’s Comedy Club is located inside the MGM Grand
	 Hotel & Casino on the Las Vegas Strip\, offering a premium comedy experie
	nce in an intimate setting with excellent sightlines and a lively atmosphe
	re. \nTicket Information\nTickets start from $83. Seating is best availabl
	e within the zone purchased — seats are not assigned until arrival. There 
	is an overall 8-ticket limit per order. All performers subject to change w
	ithout notice. \nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets \nThis post contains aff
	iliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase tickets through our lin
	ks at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. Show times subject to c
	hange. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar
	.com/event/sarah-colonna-live-at-brad-garretts-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy
	 Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/sarah-colonna-live-at-brad-garretts-co
	medy-club/
LOCATION:Brad Garrett’s Comedy Club\, 3799 S Las Vegas Blvd\, Las Vegas\, N
	V\, 89109\, USA
