SUMMARY:Mark Normand LIVE at Cobb's Comedy Club
DTSTAMP:20260803T060032Z
DTSTART:20260806T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nAbout the Performer\nMark Norm
	and is one of the hardest-working and most respected stand-up comedians in
	 the game today. Known for his rapid-fire delivery\, self-deprecating humo
	r\, and brilliantly crafted one-liners\, Normand has earned praise from co
	medy legends including Jerry Seinfeld\, who dubbed him “the best young up-
	and-coming comedian.” \nA New Orleans native based in New York\, Mark Norm
	and has released multiple acclaimed comedy specials including Out to Lunch
	\, Don’t Be Yourself\, and Soup to Nuts. He’s a regular on late-night tele
	vision\, a beloved podcast host\, and one of the most in-demand live perfo
	rmers on the comedy circuit today. \nHis shows are a masterclass in stand-
	up — tight\, clever\, and relentlessly funny from the first joke to the la
	st. Catching Mark Normand live at an intimate venue like Cobb’s Comedy Clu
	b is a rare treat that comedy fans won’t want to miss. \nEvent Details\nDa
	te: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026 (also Fri Aug 7 & Sat Aug 8)\nTime: 7:30 PM
	 PDT (Thu) | 7:30 PM & 9:45 PM (Fri) | 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM (Sat)\nVenue: Cob
	b’s Comedy Club\, 915 Columbus Avenue\, San Francisco\, CA 94133\nAge Rest
	riction: 18+ / 2 Beverage Minimum\nTicket Price Range: $38 – $65 \nAbout t
	he Venue\nCobb’s Comedy Club is San Francisco’s most celebrated stand-up d
	estination\, located at 915 Columbus Avenue in the heart of the North Beac
	h neighborhood. With a capacity of approximately 400 guests\, Cobb’s deliv
	ers an intimate\, up-close comedy experience that puts every audience memb
	er close to the action. \nThe club features a full bar and dining service\
	, with cocktails\, beer\, wine\, and food available throughout the show. T
	he classic comedy club layout — tables and chairs arranged around a centra
	l stage — creates a lively\, communal atmosphere that makes every laugh fe
	el bigger. \nCobb’s has hosted virtually every major name in comedy over i
	ts storied history and is widely regarded as one of the best comedy rooms 
	in the country. Parking is available in nearby garages\, and the venue is 
	easily accessible by BART and Muni. \nWhat to Expect\nMark Normand perform
	s five shows across the weekend of August 6–8\, giving fans multiple oppor
	tunities to catch this comedy powerhouse live. Each show is a full stand-u
	p set — fast\, funny\, and packed with the kind of sharp writing that has 
	made Normand one of the most talked-about comedians of his generation. \nT
	he 18+ age restriction and 2-beverage minimum are in effect for all shows.
	 Doors open approximately 30–45 minutes before showtime. Arrive early to s
	ecure a great seat and enjoy a pre-show drink before the laughs begin. \nT
	icket Information\nPrice Range: $38 – $65 (before taxes and fees)\nTickets
	 are available through Ticketmaster (official) and VividSeats (resale). \n
	Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate links. We ma
	y earn a commission at no extra cost to you.\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com
	/event/mark-normand-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/mark-normand-live-at-cobbs-comedy-club
