SUMMARY:Cipha Sounds LIVE at Punch Line Irving
DTSTAMP:20260803T060032Z
DTSTART:20260806T193000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nCipha Sounds (born Luis Diaz) is a Bronx-born Puerto Rican-American c
	omedian\, DJ\, and radio personality who has become one of New York City’s
	 most beloved entertainment figures. Best known for his 17-year run at leg
	endary hip-hop radio station Hot 97\, Cipha has seamlessly transitioned fr
	om the DJ booth to the comedy stage. \nAs the DJ for the iconic Dave Chapp
	elle Show and a longtime fixture of NYC’s comedy scene\, Cipha Sounds brin
	gs a uniquely hip-hop-infused energy to stand-up comedy. His humor is shar
	p\, self-aware\, and deeply rooted in his experiences growing up in the Br
	onx\, navigating the worlds of hip-hop\, radio\, and entertainment. \nCiph
	a co-hosts the popular Talk Clearlyer podcast and has performed stand-up c
	omedy around the world. He has appeared on MTV\, BET\, and Comedy Central\
	, and is known for his ability to connect with audiences through storytell
	ing\, crowd work\, and his infectious personality. Fans can expect a high-
	energy\, laugh-filled night that blends hip-hop culture with sharp comedic
	 observations. \nEvent Details\n\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026\nShow T
	ime: 7:30 PM (Doors open at 6:30 PM)\nVenue: Punch Line Irving\nAddress: 3
	10 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130\, Irving\, TX 75039\nAge Restriction: 1
	8+ with valid government-issued photo ID required\nBeverage Minimum: 2-dri
	nk minimum per person\nAdditional Dates: Also performing Fri Aug 7 at 7:00
	 PM and Sat Aug 8 at 7:00 PM & 9:15 PM\n\nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Irvi
	ng is one of the Dallas-Fort Worth area’s premier stand-up comedy clubs\, 
	located in the heart of the Las Colinas urban center in Irving\, Texas. Pa
	rt of the nationally recognized Punch Line Comedy Club brand\, this venue 
	delivers an intimate\, club-style atmosphere that puts fans close to the a
	ction. \nThe club is situated inside the vibrant Toyota Music Factory ente
	rtainment complex at 310 W Las Colinas Blvd.\, Suite 130 — a destination p
	acked with restaurants\, bars\, and entertainment options. The venue featu
	res a full bar\, table seating\, and a dedicated stage designed to maximiz
	e the comedy experience. With a capacity that keeps the room feeling perso
	nal and energetic\, every seat feels like a great seat. \nParking is avail
	able throughout the Toyota Music Factory complex\, with both surface lots 
	and a parking garage nearby. The venue is easily accessible from major hig
	hways including I-635 and TX-114\, making it convenient for attendees comi
	ng from Dallas\, Fort Worth\, and surrounding suburbs. \nWhat to Expect\nT
	his is a solo headlining stand-up comedy show featuring Cipha Sounds perfo
	rming his latest material. Expect a high-energy evening packed with hip-ho
	p references\, personal storytelling\, crowd interaction\, and sharp comed
	ic observations drawn from his decades in the entertainment industry. \nTh
	e show runs approximately 90 minutes and is recommended for mature audienc
	es. The intimate club setting at Punch Line Irving creates the perfect env
	ironment for Cipha’s conversational\, crowd-engaging style. Come ready to 
	laugh\, enjoy a drink\, and experience one of NYC’s most entertaining pers
	onalities live on stage in Irving\, Texas. \nNote: This is an 18+ event. P
	lease bring a valid\, government-issued photo ID. A 2-beverage minimum per
	 person applies. \nTicket Information\nTickets are priced from $32 – $75 d
	epending on seating section. General Admission seating starts at $32. Pref
