DESCRIPTION:Official Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\nAbout Craig Robinson\nCraig
	 Robinson is one of the most versatile entertainers in Hollywood — a comed
	ian\, actor\, and musician whose talent knows no bounds. Best known for hi
	s beloved role as Darryl Philbin on NBC’s “The Office\,” Craig has also st
	arred in blockbuster films including “Pineapple Express\,” “Hot Tub Time M
	achine\,” “Knocked Up\,” and “This Is the End.” \nCraig’s live stand-up sh
	ow is a unique experience that blends sharp comedy with his prodigious key
	board skills. He weaves hilarious stories and observations with musical in
	terludes\, creating a show that is unlike anything else in comedy. His aut
	hentic\, deadpan wit and genuine warmth make him a fan favorite wherever h
	e performs. \nWith decades of experience in comedy clubs\, theaters\, and 
	arenas\, Craig Robinson brings a polished\, high-energy performance to eve
	ry stage. His ability to connect with audiences through both laughter and 
	music makes his live show a truly unforgettable experience. \nEvent Detail
	s\nDate: Thursday\, August 6\, 2026 \nTime: 7:30 PM (Doors open one hour b
	efore the show) \nVenue: Punch Line Comedy Club – Sacramento\, 2100 Arden 
	Way\, Sacramento\, CA 95825 \nAge Restriction: 18+ event. Two-beverage min
	imum per person. No re-entry. \nAbout the Venue\nPunch Line Comedy Club Sa
	cramento is one of the most iconic comedy venues on the West Coast\, locat
	ed at 2100 Arden Way in Sacramento\, California. The intimate club seats a
	pproximately 300 guests in a tiered layout that ensures excellent sightlin
	es from every seat in the house. \nThe venue features a full bar and dinin
	g service\, with a two-beverage minimum per guest. The professional sound 
	system and warm\, welcoming atmosphere make it the perfect setting for an 
	evening of world-class entertainment. Parking is available in the surround
	ing area\, and the club is conveniently located near major Sacramento thor
	oughfares. \nPunch Line Sacramento has hosted some of the biggest names in
	 comedy and continues to be the premier destination for live stand-up in t
	he Sacramento region. \nWhat to Expect\nCraig Robinson’s live show is a on
	e-of-a-kind experience that blends stand-up comedy with live keyboard perf
	ormances. Expect hilarious stories from his time on “The Office” and Holly
	wood\, sharp observational humor\, and spontaneous musical moments that wi
	ll have the entire room singing along. \nThe show runs approximately 90 mi
	nutes and is an 18+ event with a two-beverage minimum. Craig is known for 
	his genuine crowd engagement and his ability to make every audience member
	 feel like part of the show. \nTicket Information\nPrice Range: $45 – $85 
	(includes fees) \nPurchase official tickets through Ticketmaster or find r
	esale options through VividSeats. \n\nOfficial Tickets\nResale Tickets\n\n
	This post contains affiliate links. We earn a commission if you purchase t
	ickets through our links at no extra cost to you. \nAll sales are final. S
	how times subject to change. Valid photo ID may be required for entry.\n\n
	https://comedycalendar.com/event/craig-robinson-live-at-punch-line-comedy-
	club-sacramento/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
