SUMMARY:Gianmarco Soresi: The Drama King Tour LIVE at Hawaii Theatre Center
DTSTAMP:20260803T060032Z
DTSTART:20260807T190000Z
DESCRIPTION:Official TicketsResale Tickets \nThis post contains affiliate l
	inks. We may earn a commission at no extra cost to you. \nAbout the Perfor
	mer\nGianmarco Soresi is a New York-based stand-up comedian\, actor\, and 
	creator known for his sharp societal observations\, spry energetic stage p
	resence\, and deeply personal storytelling. He has quickly risen through t
	he comedy ranks to become one of the most talked-about voices in the indus
	try. \nGianmarco’s comedy blends intelligent social commentary with self-d
	eprecating humor and theatrical flair. His unique background as both a com
	edian and actor gives his performances a dynamic quality that sets him apa
	rt from his peers. He has performed at major comedy festivals and venues a
	cross the country. \nThe Drama King Tour is Gianmarco’s most ambitious tou
	ring project to date\, having already sold out venues across the country i
	ncluding The Belasco in Los Angeles and multiple shows at San Jose Improv.
	 The Hawaii Theatre Center stop is a highly anticipated addition to this a
	cclaimed tour. \nEvent Details\nDate: Friday\, August 7\, 2026 \nShow Time
	: 7:00 PM HST \nVenue: Hawaii Theatre Center\, 1130 Bethel Street\, Honolu
	lu\, HI 96813 \nContent Note: Stand-up comedy for mature audiences. Please
	 check venue policies for age restrictions. \nAbout the Venue\nThe Hawaii 
	Theatre Center is one of Honolulu’s most historic and beloved performance 
	venues\, located at 1130 Bethel Street in the heart of downtown Honolulu. 
	Built in 1922\, this stunning Beaux-Arts theater has been beautifully rest
	ored and is listed on the National Register of Historic Places. \nThe Hawa
	ii Theatre seats approximately 1\,400 guests and features a gorgeous ornat
	e interior with excellent acoustics and sightlines from every seat. The ve
	nue’s grand architecture and intimate atmosphere create a truly special se
	tting for live performances. \nLocated in downtown Honolulu\, the Hawaii T
	heatre Center is easily accessible from Waikiki and surrounding neighborho
	ods. Parking is available in nearby public parking structures\, and the ve
	nue is served by multiple bus routes. \nWhat to Expect\nGianmarco Soresi’s
	 Drama King Tour at Hawaii Theatre Center promises to be one of the stando
	ut comedy events of the summer in Honolulu. The historic venue provides a 
	stunning backdrop for Gianmarco’s theatrical\, high-energy performance sty
	le. \nExpect a full headline set featuring Gianmarco’s signature blend of 
	sharp social commentary\, personal storytelling\, and theatrical comedy. H
	is shows are known for their intelligence\, heart\, and ability to make au
	diences both think and laugh simultaneously. \nThis is a one-night-only ev
	ent at one of Honolulu’s most iconic venues. Given the demand from his nat
	ional tour\, tickets are expected to sell out well in advance. \nTicket In
	formation\nPrice Range: From $68 \nSecure your seats now through the offic
	ial ticket link or find resale tickets through VividSeats. \nOfficial Tick
	etsResale Tickets\n\nhttps://comedycalendar.com/event/gianmarco-soresi-the
	-drama-king-tour-live-at-hawaii-theatre-center/\n\nFrom Comedy Calendar
URL:https://comedycalendar.com/event/gianmarco-soresi-the-drama-king-tour-l
	ive-at-hawaii-theatre-center/
LOCATION:Hawaii Theatre Center\, 1130 Bethel Street\, Honolulu\, HI\, 96813
	\, United States
